# Upstream ledger exceptions.
#
# `script/check-upstream-ledger` fails when a SHA in the rejection ledger is
# also present as an absorbed commit in git history. Each entry below is a
# known case where the sync report still says C but the commit was absorbed
# later. Fix the report, run ./script/backfill-upstream-ledger, then delete
# the line.
#
# Format: <sha-prefix>  <reason>
